<title>THAILAND: Grammy 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Grammy 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					  Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 11.66     vs	    8.85</p>
<p>    Net			 582.90     vs	  442.43</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is Grammy Entertainment Plc, a music production company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-6520642</p>
</text>
